{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "2c2b382080690dd9005cc97f3389b851efe088841a41ea76d13cce21778e8f41", "ja": "お互いさま", "zh": "彼此彼此", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c2c142ced30ccaebedffa8ffaa96cc554fa0bc1d87551f920aa22e5843786c59", "ja": "親睦を深めるため、レッスン後に街へ出かけ\nるジュリアと恵美。アクセサリーショップや\nレコードショップなど、お互いに行きつけの\n店を紹介しあう。正反対ゆえに補い合える事\nに気づいたふたりは、より結束を固める。", "zh": "为了增进感情，茱莉亚和恵美在课后一起去街上逛。两人互相介绍各自常去的店，如饰品店和唱片店等。她们发现彼此性格截然相反，却恰好能互补，于是更加紧密地联结在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "156f12c990c390d1e203e3898e3dd7c1783f387fd3d125c7bb705695d062e053", "ja": "ふぅ……基礎レッスン終わり、っと。\nなあ恵美、今日{$P$}って見たか？", "zh": "呼……基础训练结束了，嗯。喂，惠美，今天见到{$P$}了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "6c272550e05e0fb132904d53ed87ae7c54efb910237b9eb0a8d952359580f8a1", "ja": "朝、廊下でちょっとすれ違ったけど、\nメッチャ忙しそうだったよ～。", "zh": "早上在走廊碰到了一下，\n看起来超级忙的样子～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "fc680bfb4f7d0dc6d94ad074fe76020689a88df127ba18363f659164d9022e69", "ja": "おいおい、マジで大丈夫かよ……。\nま、ウチらはウチらで、やれる事やるしかないけど。", "zh": "喂喂，真的没问题吗……  \n不过，咱们也只能做好咱们能做的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "8dadcfebeadcd7f0fa7ee0766dc5d1747de45c297dbeace6ed8dd83135b4f84a", "ja": "そだね。ボイトレとか予定合わせて……。\nあ、そだ！　ねえねえジュリア、今日これからヒマ？", "zh": "是啊。先把声乐训练之类的时间安排好……\n啊，对了！喂喂，茱莉亚，今天接下来有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "9a3c27cc56a79baad9536c9032d28443350165f283a473f9cbd4df1ca80e4ea1", "ja": "ん？　ヒマっつーか……まあ、予定はないけど。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？闲倒是不至于……不过确实没什么安排。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "781bb5f1318d943764680387818be2ef83fa62b184c3d8bf0db6e5e5d07a02fb", "ja": "せっかくデュオなんだし、もっと仲良くなりたくない？\nって事で～……ふたりで遊び行っちゃお♪", "zh": "难得是两人组合，不想变得更要好吗？\n所以呢～……我们一起出去玩吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "50d54bb31df50d6c83843379bfa8dfe6108afac5f685162253bb802370fd52ba", "ja": "はぁ～。恵美はいつも、こういう店に来てんのか……。\nあたしにとっちゃ、異世界って感じだな。", "zh": "唉～。惠美平时总来这种店吗……\n对我来说，简直就像异世界一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "58ea56f11764166cb6abd629ce27264e2fdee2710b4f6466729e34faf832c0e5", "ja": "にゃはは、なにそれ！　ちゃんと現実世界だってば。\nジュリアは普段、こういうお店来ないの？", "zh": "呀哈哈，什么嘛！当然是现实世界啦。\n茱莉亚平时不来这种店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7c2e1d43870cc8a12ad03da129d88fc3d39602f31ca5dfd5d591a2b72eb05ae", "ja": "あんまりだな。方向性も違うし……。\nパンク系のシルバーを、たまに覗くくらいさ。", "zh": "不太来。方向也不一样……  \n偶尔会去看看朋克风的银饰就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "bee98b2a4abc83558cd89fa90a5ef0b570d5f12f336b627054596c6cb2b9976a", "ja": "なるほどね～。んじゃ今日は、\nジュリアの新しい方向性を探してく感じで！", "zh": "原来如此～那今天就朝着寻找茱莉亚的新方向前进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd0a7f201ce479598ea078316ca58772165bc2abada0429ac647c91e31e6215e", "ja": "えっ、い、いや、あたしはいいから！\n恵美の買いたいヤツ見ようぜ……。", "zh": "诶，不、不用了，我就算了！\n先看看惠美想买的东西吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "bf037534e2e7b79f3d763d084d26cd832a1b2c496d03f9adb33ef37be65539c5", "ja": "いいからいいから！　アタシがジュリアのコーデ\n考えたいの。メッチャ可愛くしたげるよ♪", "zh": "别客气别客气！是我想帮茱莉亚\n挑搭配啦。保证把你打扮得超可爱的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "679753f804eb2e987370838f5dee93f04e3bb68a5311af259392a57ff2d50e18", "ja": "くぅ……まあ、こういうのもアイドルの勉強か。\nオッケー、覚悟決めたよ。よろしく頼む！", "zh": "唔……这也是偶像学习的一部分吧。好，我做好觉悟了！拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "fb216d0c118e6885f621f53d986f81d66d5e6901f3ff29cd124ca3ce77d2739e", "ja": "あははっ、ふたりで\nショッピングしたいだけなのに、なんか大げさだな～！", "zh": "啊哈哈，只是想两个人一起去购物而已，搞得好像很夸张似的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "dbe9d6c45ecaaae20de826213af906f5ef68bb1cc0fcc89058f346ab8dbc3224", "ja": "っと……色々買っちゃったよ。\n自分じゃ選ばないようなやつばっか。", "zh": "呃……一不小心买了好多东西。\n全都是些我自己不会选的类型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "cbdbc755b5ffe212efef6997f0f796238ecd0a6c0d970a9733851aa98b56774b", "ja": "大丈夫！　どれも絶対、ジュリアに似合うから。\nアタシのセンスを信じてよ～。", "zh": "没事的！每件都绝对很适合茱莉亚啦。\n相信我的品味吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "3878ac8ecfec60a998fae113a2a70711193cf7f50d815304df1b47f42cd59cc7", "ja": "そこは疑っちゃいないさ。\n恵美はすげえよ。マジでリスペクトだぜ。", "zh": "我可没怀疑这一点。\n惠美，你真厉害。真的打心底佩服你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "bc90fd2c14bdd04c6335fd596609c7de9b82cd35f790b46ef391924700328d51", "ja": "えぇ～、そこまで言われると照れるな～。\nまあ、慣れてるだけだと思うよ。", "zh": "诶～，你夸得我都不好意思了～。\n嗯，我觉得只是因为习惯了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "4bd79ad5f5990a86d3a24eebd5e301f7675bcd97404de69aa1af572b914c4c92", "ja": "読モは、私服の撮影がたまにあるし。\nアイドルはスタイリストさんがいるからいいよね～。", "zh": "读模有时候会有拍私服的工作嘛。偶像有造型师帮忙，真好啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef3237125fdc11f854995f3e9788341837ce97197de98f0e2d088fdf4079bbd8", "ja": "いや、それもあるけど……あたしが\n一番リスペクト感じたのは、面倒見のよさだよ。", "zh": "不，也有这个原因……但让我最为敬佩的，还是她那种特别会照顾人的性格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "185948f5631af75134bc16a8ac601a5ed94e4c49c3ef9dad7d4c4a581f086db1", "ja": "メチャクチャ親身になってくれるしさ。\n姉御肌……ってのは、ちょっと違うかもだけど。", "zh": "对我特别体贴的……  \n说是大姐头性格……好像又有点不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "19bd13ee04c984ac7f73b1df119e26ccefe138f315a2eaec9bafdb817d19b071", "ja": "え、いやいや！　そんなの普通でしょ。\n一緒に買い物来てんだし、一緒に楽しみたいじゃん。", "zh": "诶，不是不是！这不是很正常嘛。既然是一起出来买东西，当然想一起享受其中啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "c928a7557a74090333da77d3b3d72a1674f61501aea07e84382b38322288a247", "ja": "そんなもんか？　あたしはどっちかって言うと、\nそれぞれ勝手にすりゃいいって思うタイプだから。", "zh": "是这样吗？我倒是觉得，大家各做各的就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "66f2eacdfaa01e618c8251740702653a9bde0434909d888d742655ef13079ce4", "ja": "でも、憧れはするよ。\n恵美みたいに、ちゃんと友達をやれるのって。", "zh": "不过，我还是很向往那样的。\n像惠美一样，能够好好和朋友相处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "952c0c64b5358760c28304e0e843343b609c13bc6cce755e59574859b61d1db2", "ja": "そっかな～？　性格が違うだけだと思うよ。\nアタシだって、友達と喧嘩したりするし。", "zh": "是吗～？我觉得只是性格不同而已。\n我也会和朋友吵架的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "81af1ae33e8d323231d9151866b3c49a10dd4e79cbf2beae090cb37820a23859", "ja": "そうなのか？　なんか意外だな。", "zh": "是这样吗？感觉还挺意外的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "7cb95865c4b80d22e55d49d60777d4b314a80847722daaf608dd90d8098b9877", "ja": "ま、色々あるんだって！　にゃはは。", "zh": "嘛，反正各种情况都有啦！呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ee8bb664aac201cb3c41e2e33b1e05d37d71dfe34d4b72ef21518a0bf552a02", "ja": "そっか。とにかく、サンキュ！\nんじゃ次は……あたしのオススメの店、行っとくか！", "zh": "这样啊。总之，谢啦！\n那接下来……要不要去我推荐的店看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "8b5714ee4f9dd3b81aec22effcd6091befccad48e642a14cbaae27d21bbdbca1", "ja": "へえ～！　こういうレコードショップって、\n入るの初めてかも！　ジュリアはいつも来るの？", "zh": "哇～！我好像还是第一次进这种唱片店！茱莉亚经常来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "51b6e815e36115e10cb712e7e4961e696b069f0c1493068d3a5fc82eb5b5cdb3", "ja": "たまにね。掘り出し物探したりとか。", "zh": "偶尔会来。比如找找有没有什么宝贝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1033_tencho", "source_sha256": "c863328c795a8dfb2a25ece957c18bd012faa1748909152eacf4305e9c0b0fad", "ja": "おっ、いらっしゃい。今日は友達と一緒かい？", "zh": "哦，欢迎光临。今天是和朋友一起来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "69daac6b4c82a6556924826faad4f4d937c4fa28761de0a45fc7250447f2a78c", "ja": "まあね。仕事仲間。", "zh": "算是吧。工作伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "fc195df72158430fa04439a0ec3a1a06ad9da32924ceb38d48436dbd9bc85f76", "ja": "ども～！　お邪魔しまーす♪", "zh": "嗨～！打扰啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1036_tencho", "source_sha256": "b25d4839136185487e2fa10803abbe848862c168e2caaafcd8a3e17623588670", "ja": "ごゆっくり。\nよかったら、コーヒーご馳走しますよ。今淹れるから。", "zh": "请慢用。\n不介意的话，我请你喝咖啡。现在就去泡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "0c9ba8596bee82154f5fa5a5857533e6c397e910470bee15436bc62b1bcbb583", "ja": "えっ、いいの？", "zh": "诶，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1038_tencho", "source_sha256": "7852703688836118dd6361ddf2770f8125a136607ea5c277741463ca27f11669", "ja": "いいのいいの。あんたらみたいな若い人が、\nレコードに興味持ってくれたら、一番嬉しいんだ。", "zh": "没事没事。像你们这样的年轻人，\n能对唱片感兴趣，我就最高兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd08ceaace769c2e79756ef5eb2a6e339fd3c1d0714db23af78dbd363eada246", "ja": "美人に甘いんだよな、じいさん。", "zh": "老爷子还真是对美女没辙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1040_tencho", "source_sha256": "51021065427fe1a9b1ef760517896c054399176f19ba64c2327ae4ff402bffd4", "ja": "音楽好きな美人には、ね。", "zh": "对喜欢音乐的美女来说嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "1eed34fed928e4e00dcdb7073eeb9f6a60c2fd59ce8256bee8ebc9c0d89b4188", "ja": "わ～っ、嬉しい♪　いただきまーす。\nね、ジュリア、古いレコードとか詳しいの？", "zh": "哇～好开心♪我开动啦——\n我说，茱莉亚，你很懂老黑胶唱片之类的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "8d9213065e40cf29d92c4de48027746f354540bc24339f61fec1be68307c8ff4", "ja": "そこまででもないけどな。\n好きな曲を、原盤で聴きたいなって思っただけだし。", "zh": "也没那么懂啦。只是想着，想用原版唱片听听喜欢的歌而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "30458ad78cc8d50564f7f3f1e7b9df6d36abe1a1561c2704826b737a850cc4e3", "ja": "ふーん……こういう機械とか全然わかんないけど、\nちょっとカッコイイよね～！", "zh": "嗯……我完全不懂这种机器什么的，不过感觉还挺帅的嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "55b7bed0cc85c255be538bab0cf6c20f2cd2a35fd198e471d0c260e62ddfea67", "ja": "おっ、わかる！？　だよな～！\nよーし、なんでも聞いてくれよ……じいさんに！", "zh": "哦，你也懂！？就是嘛～！好，什么都尽管问我……不对，问老爷子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "0495f4e881e430daf69b3688e09f455e3fda3f260794fffb8e5ff35e9587b837", "ja": "あー、楽しかった～！\n今日はありがとね、ジュリア。めっちゃ充実感～♪", "zh": "啊～，好开心～！\n今天谢谢你啦，茱莉亚。真是太充实了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "56dd07c71f2545d70543a5cf4ff253140f366dda93bffdc544888709167ee9c3", "ja": "あたしの方こそ、楽しかったよ。", "zh": "我才要说，我也玩得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1048_020meg", "source_sha256": "ee63b2ebccdc451eda58e3c92616736e385fda79c69d675c6f67e5e8dbc38cc6", "ja": "ねね。さっきジュリア、アタシに憧れてるって言ってた\nけどさ、アタシもジュリアに憧れるとこあるんだ。", "zh": "喂。刚才茱莉亚说憧憬我来着，\n其实我也有憧憬茱莉亚的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "6aad08bced2bbe9104503a57671302acb0b4baa11f5953c49847d9a8379f581b", "ja": "好きなものは好き、って。\n自分をしっかり持ってて、ブレないところ。", "zh": "会清楚表明“喜欢就是喜欢”。\n很有自己的主见，从不动摇的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "fcd05db29ece2d0ca582caafd359311f44b03968283d0a4ad12453a4d7acc95d", "ja": "はは。それって身勝手なだけって言わないか？\n言われて悪い気はしないけどな。", "zh": "哈哈。这样不就是任性吗？\n不过，被你这么说，我倒也不讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1051_020meg", "source_sha256": "943e58002100a7b1108ecfb4cf0eb6a379d304dba2f4f0e62a12471af0fb7aac", "ja": "{$P$}が言ってた意味、\nなんかわかったかも！　アタシたち、相性がいいって。", "zh": "我好像有点明白{$P$}说的意思了！我们很合得来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "9e20472055ec69cc8384a4058b2ec29d0c4359d58696371673b86541cc4cce47", "ja": "相手に合わせられるアタシと、ブレないジュリア……\n正反対だけど、お互い補ってるって言うか。", "zh": "能配合对方的我，和始终不动摇的茱莉亚……虽然截然相反，但该说是正好互补吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "81c066f87928d6e128787946eb6ff6af05748d920979238426192d601ebdcfd9", "ja": "そうかもな。ウチらふたりなら、\nぶっ飛んだことやれそうな……そんな予感がする。", "zh": "或许吧。我们两个一起的话，感觉能做出些惊天动地的事……我有这种预感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0282_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_02_1054_020meg", "source_sha256": "ac5078cce47d852bd86a2211d5630dda05204c02bc262398fe506be660609af5", "ja": "デュオで{$P$}を\nビックリさせるんだもんね！　んじゃ、よろしく～♪", "zh": "我们要组成二重唱，让{$P$}大吃一惊！那就拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
